{%- comment -%}
  Lightweight count endpoint used by the price interval filter in custom.js.

  Requested as /collections/<handle>?view=count&<filter params>, it returns
  just the number of products matching those filters, so the sidebar can show
  a per-interval count without fetching a whole rendered collection page.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- layout none -%}
{{- collection.products_count -}}
